# ── Databases (runtime state, never source) ─────────────────────
# Two copies of flood_data.db were previously committed because DB_PATH was a
# relative path. DB_PATH is absolute and configurable now; keep the artefacts out.
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.sqlite3

# NOTE: ml_pipeline/raw/ is deliberately NOT ignored. The cached USGS and
# Open-Meteo fetches are small (~300 KB) and committing them makes the
# real-data track reproducible in CI without hitting either API.
